  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to production and marketing of family farm products from the Sao Bartolomeu River Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Associao Rede Rio So Bartolomeu de Mtua Cooperao (Rede Bart) will work with 13 rural associations in six communities to improve agricultural production processing capacity develop markets and contribute to the conservation of natural resources in So Bartolomeu River watershed Federal District Brazil. This project will benefit 480 people directly and 1200 people indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
